      "id": "evaluate-nested-powers",
      "title": "Evaluate powers from inside outward",
      "explanation": "Evaluate the nested powers from the inside outward. Since \\(1^9=1\\), the first term is\n\\[\n2^{0^{(1^9)}}=2^{0^1}=2^0=1.\n\\]\nFor the second term, start with \\(2^0=1\\):\n\\[\n\\left((2^0)^1\\right)^9=(1^1)^9=1.\n\\]\nThus the value is \\(1+1=\\boxed{2}\\), choice \\(\\text{C}\\).",
      "directNodeIds": [
